{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_107_titan-title\">TITAN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">TITAN 的特异性是三阶段 whole-slide 预训练：特征网格 iBOT、ROI caption CoCa、WSI report CoCa。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Three-stage multimodal whole-slide foundation model pretrained via iBOT on 2D tile feature grids, CoCa on synthetic ROI captions, and CoCa on whole-slide pathology reports.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">预提取病理 patch 网格、ROI 合成描述和 WSI 病理报告</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pre-extracted 2D spatial grid of WSI patch embeddings (CONCH v1.5) + ROI descriptions / clinical pathology reports</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">通用 whole-slide embedding、跨模态检索分数与病理文本生成</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">General-purpose whole-slide embedding, zero-shot slide classification, cross-modal report retrieval, and slide report generation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(d) · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-025-03982-3\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_107_titan')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_107_titan')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"TITAN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(d)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/cea0e975856606bfe37d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(d) · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_107_titan\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_107_titan')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_107_titan\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">空间化 patch feature grid</span><span class=\"lang-en\">spatial patch feature grid</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">病理 patch encoder 特征按 WSI 二维坐标重新排列</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests pre-extracted 2d spatial grid of wsi patch embeddings (conch v1.5) + roi descriptions / clinical pathology reports and prepares initial tensor representations (spatial patch feature grid).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"病理 patch encoder 特征按 WSI 二维坐标重新排列\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests pre-extracted 2d spatial grid of wsi patch embeddings (conch v1.5) + roi descriptions / clinical pathology reports and prepares initial tensor representations (spatial patch feature grid).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"空间化 patch feature grid\" data-node-name-en=\"spatial patch feature grid\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">空间化 patch feature grid</span><span class=\"lang-en\">spatial patch feature grid</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">病理 patch encoder 特征按 WSI 二维坐标重新排列</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests pre-extracted 2d spatial grid of wsi patch embeddings (conch v1.5) + roi descriptions / clinical pathology reports and prepares initial tensor representations (spatial patch feature grid).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 patch feature 当作 ViT patch embedding，建模全片上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes TITAN slide ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"TITAN slide ViT\" data-node-name-en=\"TITAN slide ViT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>TITAN slide ViT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 patch feature 当作 ViT patch embedding，建模全片上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes TITAN slide ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在 ROI/WSI 特征网格上做掩码建模与知识蒸馏\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 1 iBOT student–teacher within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Stage 1 iBOT student–teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 1 iBOT student–teacher\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stage 1 iBOT student–teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在 ROI/WSI 特征网格上做掩码建模与知识蒸馏</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 1 iBOT student–teacher within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"8k×8k ROI 与 PathChat 合成细粒度形态描述\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 2 ROI-caption pairs within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Stage 2 ROI-caption pairs\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 2 ROI-caption pairs\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stage 2 ROI-caption pairs</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">8k×8k ROI 与 PathChat 合成细粒度形态描述</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 2 ROI-caption pairs within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全切片与临床病理报告对齐\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 3 WSI-report pairs within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Stage 3 WSI-report pairs\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 3 WSI-report pairs\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stage 3 WSI-report pairs</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全切片与临床病理报告对齐</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 3 WSI-report pairs within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"编码 ROI caption 和 slide report\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CoCa text encoder within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"CoCa text encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CoCa text encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CoCa text encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">编码 ROI caption 和 slide report</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CoCa text encoder within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对视觉表示做 cross-attention 并生成描述/报告\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CoCa multimodal decoder within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"CoCa multimodal decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CoCa multimodal decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CoCa multimodal decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对视觉表示做 cross-attention 并生成描述/报告</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CoCa multimodal decoder within the core three stage ibot coca wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ROI 与 WSI 两个尺度联合优化检索和生成\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies contrastive alignment + captioning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"对比对齐 + captioning\" data-node-name-en=\"contrastive alignment + captioning\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对比对齐 + captioning</span><span class=\"lang-en\">contrastive alignment + captioning</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ROI 与 WSI 两个尺度联合优化检索和生成</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies contrastive alignment + captioning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"支持零样本、检索、报告生成和线性探测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces general-purpose whole-slide embedding, zero-shot slide classification, cross-modal report retrieval, and slide report generation via TITAN slide.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"TITAN slide 表示与语言能力\" data-node-name-en=\"TITAN slide\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_107_titan', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">TITAN slide 表示与语言能力</span><span class=\"lang-en\">TITAN slide</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">支持零样本、检索、报告生成和线性探测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces general-purpose whole-slide embedding, zero-shot slide classification, cross-modal report retrieval, and slide report generation via TITAN slide.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"TITAN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 病理 tile、切片—文本对齐与报告生成三阶段目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Three-Stage Slide Pretraining: Grid iBOT + ROI Caption CoCa + Clinical WSI Report CoCa</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"TITAN：核心公式 · 病理 tile、切片—文本对齐与报告生成三阶段目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"107\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.339504pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.011212 256.400183 21.339504\" width=\"256.400183pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M12.317446 10.937813H12.06931C11.721921 13.11148 10.908036 14.262828 9.697135 14.262828H2.104189L7.523468 7.32496L2.898223 .516122H9.151237C10.421691 .516122 11.106545 1.240677 11.473785 3.444121H11.692144L11.59289 0H1.161274L6.471374 7.622722L.426793 15.285146H12.118938L12.317446 10.937813Z\" id=\"m107_g4-213\"></path><use id=\"m107_g10-0\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-0\"></use><use id=\"m107_g10-76\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-76\"></use><use id=\"m107_g10-106\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-106\"></use><use id=\"m107_g10-184\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-184\"></use><use id=\"m107_g10-185\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-185\"></use><use id=\"m107_g10-186\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m107_g7-186\"></use><path d=\"